        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: H. G. Wells, Rubén Darío\n- Roles: writer, poet\n- Topics: English literature, Nicaraguan literature, modernismo\n\nFacts:\n- H. G. Wells was born on 21 September 1866 and died on 13 August 1946.\n- H. G. Wells, born Herbert George Wells, was an English writer.\n- Rubén Darío was born on January 18, 1867 and died on February 6, 1916.\n- Rubén Darío, born Félix Rubén García Sarmiento, was a Nicaraguan poet.\n- Rubén Darío initiated the Spanish-American literary movement known as modernismo, which flourished at the end of the 19th century.",
